# Tharwati v0.1 needs NO environment variables or secrets: it is a local-only app
# with no backend, no analytics and no payment integration.
#
# When server features are added, list variable NAMES here (never real values),
# and keep the real values in the server's secret store, not in the mobile app.
#
# Examples of future names (unused today):
# PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON_PATH=   # server-side purchase verification only
# AI_PROVIDER_API_KEY=              # server-side AI proxy only, never in the app
